# Legends Of Glory

`legends-of-glory/` is the source of the Base44 app **Legends Of Glory**.

- App ID: `6a2db64ae683a6c053ea9251`
- Editor: https://app.base44.com/apps/6a2db64ae683a6c053ea9251/editor/preview
- Published site: https://legendsofgloryonline.base44.app
- This app is not connected to GitHub. The Base44 sandbox is the live copy the editor preview uses.

When you change files in this folder, write the same change back to that sandbox (Base44 MCP `edit_file` / `write_file`, or `base44 sandbox edit` / `base44 sandbox write` with this app ID) so the preview updates. Do not run `base44 deploy`, `base44 entities push`, or `base44 functions deploy`. Those bypass the sandbox and get overwritten on the next sync.

Do not commit `legends-of-glory/.env.local` or `legends-of-glory/base44/.app.jsonc`.
